{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15106996","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15106996","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1510699601:1":{"text":"The wind isn't howling anymore...","source_cn":"风声不再凄厉了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB564DE5F838D97CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510699602:0":{"text":"This... will free the dead?","source_cn":"这样……就能让死去的人得到解脱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA675EE862DE71096","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510699603:1":{"text":"Yes. The lost souls have returned to the Tree of Life and entered the next cycle.","source_cn":"嗯。迷途的生命已经回归生命树，进入下一个轮回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AC055BC4F392D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1510699603":{"text":"Yes. The lost souls have returned to the Tree of Life and entered the next cycle.","source_cn":"嗯。迷途的生命已经回归生命树，进入下一个轮回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AC055BC4F392D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510699604:0":{"text":"Of course, we can't let Sarethiel get away that easily.","source_cn":"当然，不能让他这么轻易跑了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC57EB07BDD39827F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Of course, we can't let Sarethiel get away that easily.","female":"Of course, we can't let Sarethiel get away that easily.","variant_male_record_index":"175124","variant_female_record_index":"175125","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510699605:0":{"text":"Another game of cat and mouse. How droll...","source_cn":"又要开始你逃我追的游戏，真麻烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADFAF92963463ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1510699605":{"text":"Another game of cat and mouse. How droll...","source_cn":"又要开始你逃我追的游戏，真麻烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADFAF92963463ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510699606:0":{"text":"How does he do that?","source_cn":"他有这种能力？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD988C26BEB214352","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How does he do that?","female":"How does he do that?","variant_male_record_index":"175127","variant_female_record_index":"175128","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510699607:0":{"text":"... It's a power gifted to me by the Divine One. The power to track prey.","source_cn":"……是狩猎神赐予我的力量，追猎之能。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCEB326AA8E98FDF2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... It's a power gifted to me by the Divine One. The power to track prey.","female":"... It's a power gifted to me by the Divine One. The power to track prey.","variant_male_record_index":"175129","variant_female_record_index":"175130","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510699608:0":{"text":"Oh, \"great\" Hunting God, if you have this kind of power, why didn't you use it to help us look for the God of Harvest?","source_cn":"噢，“伟大的”狩猎神，你既然有这种力量，我们找丰饶神的...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC5D5082C3CFE3400","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Oh, \"great\" Hunting God, if you have this kind of power, why didn't you use it to help us look for the God of Harvest?","female":"Oh, \"great\" Hunting Goddess, if you have this kind of power, why didn't you use it to help us look for the God of Harvest?","variant_male_record_index":"175131","variant_female_record_index":"175132","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1510699608":{"text":"Oh, \"great\" Hunting God, if you have this kind of power, why didn't you use it to help us look for the God of Harvest?","source_cn":"噢，“伟大的”狩猎神，你既然有这种力量，我们找丰饶神的时候，你怎么不帮忙？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC5D5082C3CFE3400","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Oh, \"great\" Hunting God, if you have this kind of power, why didn't you use it to help us look for the God of Harvest?","female":"Oh, \"great\" Hunting Goddess, if you have this kind of power, why didn't you use it to help us look for the God of Harvest?","variant_male_record_index":"175131","variant_female_record_index":"175132","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510699609:0":{"text":"Nazrik, now you know we aren't Sarethiel's worshippers, and you've seen the fallen god's powers yourself.","source_cn":"那非，你的意志坚定而正直，你已经知晓我们并非赛图恩的信...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE5C7EEA9EFA4529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510699610:1":{"text":"He certainly won't let this battle go unavenged. If he turns his wrath on the Wildborn, Wrathwood Grove will become the next Tuttleton.","source_cn":"此番战斗，他必然不会善罢甘休。若迁怒于雅库伯尔，树怒山...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57396EBBC127353F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510699611:1":{"text":"In the name of the Arcane Council, I ask you to help us track down the God of Harvest.","source_cn":"我以魔法师协会的名义恳请，可否用你的能力追猎他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069E693E02DF542A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510699612:1":{"text":"... Understood, I'll see what I can do.","source_cn":"……知道了。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4C04948B6F56A84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510699613:1":{"text":"Nazrik readies his spear, takes a deep breath, and then the bone-shaped spear streaks out like a bolt of lightning.","source_cn":"那非抽出投矛，右手持握。他深吸一口气，入定，屏息。矛闪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86AE96A998E12C03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510699614:0":{"text":"In a flash of red, the spear rockets skyward, vanishing into the ether. Nazrik's brow tightens.","source_cn":"红光一闪，似骨似石的投矛飞向空中，随即像被传送了一般消...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EEB556F8097A293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510699615:0":{"text":"The spear is pointing towards... <style=\"highlight\">Halia</style>.","source_cn":"方位指向……<style=highlight>呼临城<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3D12611DF86A36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1510699615":{"text":"The spear is pointing towards... <style=\"highlight\">Halia</style>.","source_cn":"方位指向……<style=highlight>呼临城</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3D12611DF86A36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510699616:1":{"text":"He's weakened after the battle. But the Halians are still his followers and don't know the truth. They're going to walk into their own graves!","source_cn":"受到重创之后，他的力量已大不如前，但呼临城的民众皆为丰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2EF78256078DBFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510699617:0":{"text":"We have to catch up to him fast... Come quickly!","source_cn":"我们必须尽快追上他……与我同行吧，友人们！","status":"matched",